{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">哥倫比亞有非法金礦發生山泥傾瀉，最少13死、7人傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.COL.GOLDMINE-0600_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026PU6vYdsbHx1787269093.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.COL.GOLDMINE-0600_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當局出動剷泥車清理沙泥，搜索有否生還者。有目擊者稱出事時曾聽到爆炸聲，據報其中4名死者來自同一個原住民家庭。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.COL.GOLDMINE-0600_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20265yKJu8FsAw1787269089.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.COL.GOLDMINE-0600_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在哥倫比亞東南部的波利卡爾帕市，當局稱工人周三在金礦工作期間突然有山泥倒塌，又指武裝組織在當地非法採礦試圖賺取利潤，再資助販毒等非法活動。有估計指哥倫比亞約有40萬人從事採礦工作，部分工人掘出貴金屬及寶石，再出售賺錢以維持生計。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T23:59:54.913237+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}